#: src/components/prism/PrismUpdates.tsx
#~ msgid "Under OD 5 the hit windows are wide enough that pressing every key on a steady beat still hits most of the notes. Prism now judges that mash against the chart's hit windows, and when a section mashed gets 90% or more while being much easier than reading it, the section is rated as the mash. Charts at OD 5 and up are not checked."
