#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "With fewer than 20 eligible clears the average is over the evidence you have; you do not need 20 different charts. A skill you have fewer than four qualifying passes in gets no dan of its own, and a side you have fewer than four on gets no estimate at all rather than a shaky one."
